---
import { VAGARO_FACTS_CHECKED_DATE, VAGARO_SOURCES } from '@/lib/seo/vagaroAlternativeContent';
const pricing=VAGARO_SOURCES[0].url,terms=VAGARO_SOURCES[1].url;
---
<section id="vagaro-pricing" class="fresha-alt__section" aria-labelledby="vagaro-alt-costs-title"><div class="container">
<header class="fresha-alt__intro">
<p class="fresha-alt__eyebrow">VAGARO PRICING EXPLAINED</p>
<h2 id="vagaro-alt-costs-title" class="fresha-alt__h2">Vagaro pricing and marketplace fees in the UK</h2>
<p class="fresha-alt__lead">Vagaro charges by bookable calendar and offers access to a consumer marketplace. Your total cost can depend on the number of calendars, optional products and how new customers find your business.</p>
<p class="fresha-alt-costs__checked">Official UK information checked {VAGARO_FACTS_CHECKED_DATE} · <a href={pricing} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vagaro UK pricing</a></p>
</header>
<ul class="fresha-alt-costs__grid">
<li class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__item"><p class="fresha-alt-costs__kicker">VAGARO · ONE BOOKABLE CALENDAR</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__figure">£20</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__unit">per month shown · £30 crossed out</p><ul class="fresha-alt-costs__notes"><li>Displayed price may be promotional; confirm the live quote and terms.</li><li>Additional bookable calendars change the quote.</li><li>Vagaro advertises a 30-day trial.</li></ul></li>
<li class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__item"><p class="fresha-alt-costs__kicker">VAGARO · UK CLIENT ACQUISITION</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__figure">20%</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__unit">qualifying new client's first appointment</p><ul class="fresha-alt-costs__notes"><li>Applies to specified marketplace and partner channels under UK terms.</li><li>Own-channel conditions depend on Fill My Books settings.</li><li>Not a universal fee on every appointment; VAT may be additional.</li></ul></li>
<li class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__item"><p class="fresha-alt-costs__kicker">KERSIVO STARTER</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__figure">£0</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__unit">per month · up to four barbers</p><ul class="fresha-alt-costs__notes"><li>Hosted booking page and core booking system.</li><li>Every public booking takes at least £5 online, as a deposit or full payment.</li><li>0% KERSIVO commission; Stripe processing fees apply.</li></ul></li>
<li class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__item"><p class="fresha-alt-costs__kicker">FULL KERSIVO</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__figure">£39</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__unit">per location / month</p><ul class="fresha-alt-costs__notes"><li>Branded website and standard domain included.</li><li>No per-barber subscription fee (fair use applies).</li><li>Full CRM, reports, retail pickup and flexible booking payment controls.</li></ul></li>
</ul>
<div class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__marketplace"><div class="fresha-alt-costs__marketplace-body"><h3 class="fresha-alt-costs__h3">When does Vagaro's 20% new-client fee apply?</h3><ul class="fresha-alt-list"><li>The UK participation agreement covers qualifying first appointments originating through an active Vagaro Marketplace listing.</li><li>It also sets channel-based conditions for Instagram/partner networks and for a business's booking widgets, MySite or branded app.</li><li>Own-channel bookings have different new-client conditions if Fill My Books is disabled.</li><li>KERSIVO does not operate a consumer marketplace or apply a KERSIVO acquisition commission.</li></ul></div><div class="fresha-alt-costs__marketplace-aside"><p class="fresha-alt-costs__example">Illustration only: 20% of a qualifying £30 first appointment is £6, before any applicable VAT. This is not a prediction of your Vagaro costs or a payment-processing estimate.</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__checked">Source: <a href={terms} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vagaro UK terms</a></p></div></div>
<p class="fresha-alt-costs__note">Marketplace discovery may be valuable for shops actively seeking new clients. Compare its potential benefit with the booking-channel rules and your actual Vagaro account quote. Card-processing costs and optional features are separate from the subscription and acquisition fees.</p>
</div></section>